        "size_soon_note": "",
        "description_accordion_body": "The Studio Performance Skin Closed Sole is the premium grip system made for barre and Pilates, replacing traditional studio socks for thousands of practitioners. <em>Full contact 360° grip</em> across the entire underfoot, not silicone dots like a grip sock, for consistent traction every transition, every pose.\n\nSkin safe. No latex. No silicone. Wash with warm soapy water and dry in seconds.\n\nClosed Sole covers the entire bottom of the foot, heel included, and your toes stay fully exposed for <em>natural toe splay</em>, <em>better balance</em>, and a more stable grip. Both perform identically: same grip, same stability. Choice is preference and feel only.\n\nBuilt for Reformer, <em>Cadillac Reformer</em>, Megaformer, Lagree, and mat Pilates, and <em>great for yoga on or off the mat</em>.",
